~ start
Polyphemus: Thank you for taking care of my sheep. But with this storm brewing it’s getting too dark to find the rest of them. 
Nobody: I’m sorry that I startled your flock, I hope you’ll be able to catch them all come sunrise. 
Polyphemus: I hope so too little man. May my father protect them through this storm. But.. oh I haven’t even introduced myself. My name is Polyphemus, I am the shepherd of this here flock and your humble host through this storm.
- Friendly introduction
	Nobody: It’s a pleasure to meet you Polyphemus, I thank you for your hospitality. But if you allow me the question, who is your father?
	$> ScoreManager.resolve_good_answer()
- Ignore introduction
	Nobody: Who is your father?
	$> ScoreManager.resolve_evil_answer()
Polyphemus: The mighty Poseidon of course! The Stormbringer and god of the sea!
- Impressed
	Nobody: No wonder a man such as yourself has an equally impressive father.
	Polyphemus: You flatter me little man *blushes*.
	$> ScoreManager.resolve_good_answer()
- Doubt
	Nobody: And my father is the almighty Zeus *laughs*.
	Polyphemus: Believe what you will but know that disrespecting the gods can have its consequences.
	$> ScoreManager.resolve_evil_answer()
Polyphemus: But enough of that, I promised you a meal and you shall get one. A platter of my best cheeses and grapes.
- Compliment
	Nobody: *chomp chomp* By the gods that is the best cheese I've ever eaten. You are a true master of your craft! But I also brought something with me, Polyphemus, a fine wine which I acquired on my journey.
	$> ScoreManager.resolve_good_answer()
- Critique
	Nobody: *chomp chomp* I’ve had much better but everything tastes good if you pair it with this fine wine which I’ve acquired on my journey. It is my gift for your hospitality.
	$> ScoreManager.resolve_evil_answer()
Polyphemus: Thank you for this gift. It is a much appreciated little man. Let us feast and drink till the rosy fingers of dawn call us to work again. To Us!
- To Us!
	Nobody: To Us!
	$> ScoreManager.resolve_good_answer()
- To Ithaca!
	Nobody: To my home Ithaca!
	$> ScoreManager.resolve_evil_answer()
Polyphemus: ...
Nobody: ...
Polyphemus: ZZZzzz
Nobody: ZZZzzz
Polyphemus: Wake up little man! I plan to search for the rest of my flock and it would be much appreciated if you could tend to the needs of my sheep until I've returned.
- Flirt
	Nobody: Of course Big Guy. 
	$> ScoreManager.resolve_good_answer()
- Reluctantly agree
	Nobody: If I have too.
	$> ScoreManager.resolve_evil_answer()
